title: Removing it
pid: 04e11367-3397-45ae-ad67-34b9b69a2fb5
body: |2-
  =skg-strip-attribution= (Emacs, on the headline; =:SkgStripAttribution=
  in Neovim; the word =stripAttribution= in a handle of skg-for-ai)
  writes the request =stripAttribution=; the next save removes the
  attribution. A note meant as your own words, an evergreen note say,
  need not keep one; a reply in a dialog should.
